flowchart TD
    A["候选自主权限（Candidate autonomy）"] --> B["默认零自主，逐档申请（Start at zero, add one degree at a time）"]
    B --> C{"该任务类型有实证可靠记录吗？（Demonstrated reliable?）"}
    C -- "没有：只是『应该没问题』" --> D["维持监督（Keep oversight）"]
    C -- "有实证" --> E{"动作可逆，或监督能拦住错误？（Reversible or guarded?）"}
    E -- "否" --> F["不可逆动作一律人工确认（Human confirms the irreversible）"]
    E -- "是" --> G["按档授权，持续验证（Grant that degree, keep verifying）"]
    G -. "例行任务会以非常规方式失败：变更后回撤重验" .-> B
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class B,G core;
    class C,E gate;
    class A,D,F out;
